LINE 1: ...ELECT * FROM cypher('cypher_set', $$MATCH (n) SET wrong_var....
                                                             ^
SELECT * FROM cypher('cypher_set', $$MATCH (n) SET i = 3$$) AS (a agtype);
ERROR:  SET clause expects a map
LINE 1: ...ELECT * FROM cypher('cypher_set', $$MATCH (n) SET i = 3$$) A...
                                                             ^
